WEBVTT

00:00:19.280 --> 00:00:25.670
Saint Seiya

00:01:31.560 --> 00:01:34.210
Beyond tens of billions of light years.

00:01:34.400 --> 00:01:37.040
Past immense darkness.

00:01:37.320 --> 00:01:39.530
The world you reach upstream
the Acheron River.

00:01:44.580 --> 00:01:48.430
The infinite pasture near the Lethe river.

00:01:49.490 --> 00:01:55.210
The utopia only those chosen
by God can enter after death.

00:01:56.080 --> 00:02:00.210
Where there is no hunger,
war, suffering or sadness.

00:02:00.470 --> 00:02:05.990
A haven of eternal peace free from evil.

00:02:06.950 --> 00:02:10.080
It is called Elysion.

00:02:11.340 --> 00:02:12.670
This is...

00:02:23.110 --> 00:02:24.920
The Gold Cloths...

00:02:24.920 --> 00:02:26.770
Have crossed the other dimensions...

00:02:26.770 --> 00:02:28.860
To come help us.

00:02:31.370 --> 00:02:33.780
The Sagittarius Cloth!

00:02:35.260 --> 00:02:37.920
The Aquarius Cloth!

00:02:39.160 --> 00:02:41.680
The Libra Cloth!

00:02:43.090 --> 00:02:45.660
The Virgo Cloth!

00:02:47.050 --> 00:02:49.340
The Leo Cloth!

00:02:50.330 --> 00:02:53.550
Us five, together with the
spirit of the Gold Saints,

00:02:53.550 --> 00:02:55.780
have donned the Gold Cloths!

00:02:56.480 --> 00:03:04.500
Legendary God Cloths

00:03:11.360 --> 00:03:13.340
The Gold Cloths...

00:03:14.320 --> 00:03:17.710
The Gold Cloths have come to save us.

00:03:18.940 --> 00:03:21.450
They protect Athena even after death.

00:03:22.560 --> 00:03:23.430
Old Master.

00:03:23.780 --> 00:03:25.510
My master, Camus.

00:03:26.180 --> 00:03:29.590
Aioros, Aioria, Shaka.

00:03:30.860 --> 00:03:34.560
Who could have sent the Gold Cloths

00:03:34.700 --> 00:03:38.090
to Elysion from hell other than God?

00:03:39.580 --> 00:03:40.400
God?

00:03:41.460 --> 00:03:42.400
Could it be?

00:03:42.730 --> 00:03:43.890
Lord Hades.

00:03:44.260 --> 00:03:47.140
This enormous Cosmo, other than Athena's...

00:03:47.840 --> 00:03:51.780
Could the Gold Cloths have been

00:03:51.890 --> 00:03:55.120
sent by Poseidon?

00:03:55.920 --> 00:03:56.800
Impossible!

00:03:56.950 --> 00:04:01.550
Poseidon was put into a
deep sleep again by Athena.

00:04:01.980 --> 00:04:04.820
Then how?

00:04:08.450 --> 00:04:09.610
Master Julian.

00:04:10.320 --> 00:04:11.670
Master Julian Solo.

00:04:15.580 --> 00:04:17.800
What is going on?

00:04:18.240 --> 00:04:21.120
Master Julian has been acting weird.

00:04:22.000 --> 00:04:24.260
It's as if he's a different person.

00:04:24.720 --> 00:04:29.210
It's as if the one from the
Temple of the Sea has revived.

00:04:29.210 --> 00:04:31.000
I am afraid to approach him.

00:04:33.310 --> 00:04:35.490
Could Poseidon's soul have entered

00:04:35.580 --> 00:04:38.770
into Master Julian's body again?

00:04:39.500 --> 00:04:40.700
Sorrento.

00:04:43.520 --> 00:04:44.770
There's no mistake.

00:04:45.310 --> 00:04:49.410
Master Julian is once again Poseidon.

00:04:50.800 --> 00:04:52.230
But why?

00:04:52.880 --> 00:04:57.600
Sorrento, I just lent a helping hand to

00:04:57.600 --> 00:04:59.880
Athena's Saints.

00:04:59.880 --> 00:05:03.360
Huh? Athena's Saints?

00:05:03.590 --> 00:05:06.650
Hmm. Did you really think

00:05:06.730 --> 00:05:10.380
this eclipse was a

00:05:10.380 --> 00:05:11.340
natural phenomenon?

00:05:14.740 --> 00:05:17.010
Hmm. No, not only you.

00:05:18.040 --> 00:05:20.310
Most people on the Earth are probably

00:05:20.580 --> 00:05:23.630
thinking this is just an ordinary eclipse.

00:05:24.480 --> 00:05:29.250
They assume even if the sun is covered
by the moon, it will come out again.

00:05:29.980 --> 00:05:32.190
But this eclipse is different.

00:05:32.190 --> 00:05:35.070
This eclipse is happening
simultaneously around the world.

00:05:35.630 --> 00:05:37.590
Don't you think it is strange?

00:05:38.660 --> 00:05:40.140
But I know.

00:05:41.480 --> 00:05:45.360
Once it's covered by the moon,

00:05:45.970 --> 00:05:50.590
the sun will never show its face again.

00:05:50.740 --> 00:05:54.100
What do you mean?

00:05:54.410 --> 00:05:57.210
This is the doings of Hades.

00:06:01.340 --> 00:06:04.290
Hades. Lord Hades.

00:06:04.780 --> 00:06:05.720
Right.

00:06:06.000 --> 00:06:09.380
Hades is trying to make

00:06:09.380 --> 00:06:11.490
the Earth a part of his Underworld.

00:06:12.080 --> 00:06:13.770
How could he do such a thing?

00:06:14.480 --> 00:06:18.300
Right now Athena and the
Saints are fighting in

00:06:18.480 --> 00:06:21.390
the Underworld to prevent
this from happening.

00:06:22.340 --> 00:06:26.590
Unfortunately, I am bound by Athena.

00:06:26.920 --> 00:06:29.410
I was only able to send them

00:06:29.410 --> 00:06:32.500
few Gold Cloths.

00:06:35.370 --> 00:06:38.210
Master Julian! No, Poseidon.

00:06:39.250 --> 00:06:41.730
Sorrento, is something wrong?

00:06:42.480 --> 00:06:43.690
Poseidon.

00:06:44.090 --> 00:06:46.790
Now, let's continue our journey.

00:06:47.080 --> 00:06:50.040
Poor children around the world are

00:06:50.040 --> 00:06:52.410
waiting to hear your flute, Sorrento.

00:06:53.670 --> 00:06:54.750
I see.

00:06:55.080 --> 00:06:57.810
In order to stop the plans of Hades

00:06:57.810 --> 00:06:59.900
Poseidon has been

00:06:59.900 --> 00:07:02.270
revived just for a moment.

00:07:03.410 --> 00:07:05.400
He used to fight himself,

00:07:05.610 --> 00:07:09.910
but I pray for you all to keep the
world from falling into darkness,

00:07:10.280 --> 00:07:11.910
Athena's Saints.

00:07:19.810 --> 00:07:23.940
I see. Poseidon can't watch Hades

00:07:23.940 --> 00:07:26.730
taking over the land he was after.

00:07:26.840 --> 00:07:29.520
So he desperately sent them

00:07:29.520 --> 00:07:32.030
the Gold Cloths from inside the urn.

00:07:32.780 --> 00:07:33.790
What?

00:07:34.040 --> 00:07:35.350
Poseidon?

00:07:35.850 --> 00:07:39.220
Poseidon sent the Gold Cloths to us.

00:07:39.440 --> 00:07:42.550
Pitiful Poseidon giving

00:07:42.550 --> 00:07:44.870
Athena a hand after the defeat.

00:07:44.870 --> 00:07:47.340
Perhaps he loves the Earth that much.

00:07:49.120 --> 00:07:51.710
And he believes he has now

00:07:51.720 --> 00:07:54.450
guaranteed you victory.

00:07:54.680 --> 00:07:58.040
Poseidon, who stands amongst

00:07:58.040 --> 00:07:59.970
Zeus and Lord Hades,

00:07:59.980 --> 00:08:01.500
is too naive.

00:08:04.260 --> 00:08:05.660
What did you say?

00:08:06.240 --> 00:08:08.500
The Gold Cloths have

00:08:08.500 --> 00:08:11.240
lead you to victory until now.

00:08:11.240 --> 00:08:13.460
Not any longer.

00:08:14.020 --> 00:08:16.130
Though once an opponent,

00:08:16.280 --> 00:08:20.310
we will not let the armor
from Poseidon go to waste.

00:08:20.710 --> 00:08:23.850
To answer Old Master's wishes...

00:08:23.950 --> 00:08:26.960
To pay respects to the
spirits of my master Camus.

00:08:27.060 --> 00:08:28.570
Let's go, brother.

00:08:28.570 --> 00:08:29.170
Yes!

00:08:31.810 --> 00:08:34.300
Become a meteor and soar the Milky Way!

00:08:34.310 --> 00:08:35.550
Pegasus Meteor!

00:08:36.190 --> 00:08:40.170
Watch the dragon climb the Ancient Peaks.

00:08:40.310 --> 00:08:42.690
Rising Dragon!

00:08:42.690 --> 00:08:46.890
Feel the wrath of Cygnus of the ice world.

00:08:46.900 --> 00:08:49.100
Diamond Dust!

00:08:49.180 --> 00:08:51.500
Stars that swirl through the galaxy...

00:08:51.650 --> 00:08:53.570
Explode into a storm!

00:08:53.570 --> 00:08:55.690
Nebula Storm!

00:08:55.850 --> 00:08:59.620
Take the wings of the risen Phoenix!

00:09:00.110 --> 00:09:02.450
Flying Phoenix!

00:09:02.590 --> 00:09:03.680
What?

00:09:07.150 --> 00:09:08.500
This power.

00:09:23.210 --> 00:09:24.500
We did it.

00:09:24.730 --> 00:09:26.690
We defeated Thanatos.

00:09:26.690 --> 00:09:29.500
It's all due to the Gold Cloths.

00:09:29.640 --> 00:09:32.230
Everyone, let's hurry to Miss Saori.

00:09:32.230 --> 00:09:32.970
Yes!

00:09:35.010 --> 00:09:37.870
Why are you celebrating prematurely?

00:09:38.930 --> 00:09:40.030
What?

00:09:40.030 --> 00:09:41.880
Could it be?

00:09:43.670 --> 00:09:46.370
The rumored ultimate Cloths.

00:09:46.870 --> 00:09:51.970
I wondered how strong they could be,
but they are ultimately disappointing.

00:09:51.970 --> 00:09:53.150
No.

00:09:53.150 --> 00:09:54.080
No way.

00:09:54.080 --> 00:09:55.880
The ultimate Gold Cloths...

00:09:57.210 --> 00:10:01.920
I told you. I am an aide of
Lord Hades, but also a God.

00:10:02.110 --> 00:10:06.660
Those Gold Cloths are
nothing in the face of God.

00:10:06.910 --> 00:10:08.790
Feel the strength of God!

00:10:11.050 --> 00:10:11.950
What?

00:10:11.950 --> 00:10:12.600
No way!

00:10:18.390 --> 00:10:19.800
Useless!

00:10:26.110 --> 00:10:27.940
The Gold Cloths!

00:10:28.680 --> 00:10:29.990
Have been destroyed.

00:10:43.820 --> 00:10:46.170
No way.

00:10:47.250 --> 00:10:51.440
The greatest of the 88 Cloths.

00:10:51.680 --> 00:10:54.940
The Gold Cloths that have not been

00:10:54.940 --> 00:10:58.620
destroyed since ancient times.

00:10:58.900 --> 00:11:00.850
The ultimate Gold Cloths have

00:11:00.920 --> 00:11:03.420
fallen apart to this point.

00:11:09.840 --> 00:11:10.960
This is the end.

00:11:11.710 --> 00:11:16.190
There is nothing left for us anymore.

00:11:17.400 --> 00:11:19.440
Absolutely nothing.

00:11:23.080 --> 00:11:25.580
Do you understand, scum?

00:11:25.850 --> 00:11:28.130
No matter how many of you there are,

00:11:28.130 --> 00:11:30.300
whatever you wear on you,

00:11:30.470 --> 00:11:35.140
you are all powerless against this Thanatos.

00:11:36.030 --> 00:11:38.730
Now you Saints have been exterminated.

00:11:39.280 --> 00:11:42.530
Athena will soon die in the urn.

00:11:50.730 --> 00:11:54.910
The sun will be hidden and
the world will go dark.

00:11:54.910 --> 00:11:57.800
And the holy war from ancient times will

00:11:57.800 --> 00:12:01.610
end with Lord Hades' victory.

00:12:03.880 --> 00:12:08.280
So this is the Athena's Cloth.
I'll destroy this too!

00:12:09.580 --> 00:12:12.840
I won't let that happen.

00:12:13.810 --> 00:12:18.730
But all my strength is draining from my body.

00:12:19.050 --> 00:12:21.120
It's over.

00:12:22.440 --> 00:12:28.210
Thanatos, it seems you still haven't
finished off Pegasus and the others.

00:12:28.740 --> 00:12:31.540
Have you forgotten my warning?

00:12:31.610 --> 00:12:35.890
Or, are the Saints resisting
harder than anticipated?

00:12:37.480 --> 00:12:38.850
This Cosmo...

00:12:39.990 --> 00:12:41.130
Is it Athena?

00:12:41.840 --> 00:12:44.680
I put her to eternal sleep.

00:12:44.680 --> 00:12:48.420
And most of her blood must
have been sucked by the urn.

00:12:48.560 --> 00:12:49.880
Yet...

00:12:49.880 --> 00:12:53.100
I still feel her Cosmo.

00:12:54.000 --> 00:12:56.700
Seiya. Seiya!

00:12:57.510 --> 00:12:58.770
Seiya!

00:13:00.720 --> 00:13:01.940
Seiya.

00:13:02.700 --> 00:13:07.400
That voice belongs to Miss Saori, Athena!

00:13:08.030 --> 00:13:10.110
What has happened, Seiya?

00:13:10.580 --> 00:13:12.720
Giving up here

00:13:12.720 --> 00:13:14.870
is not like you.

00:13:15.580 --> 00:13:18.020
You have never given up

00:13:18.020 --> 00:13:21.180
a fight before.

00:13:22.310 --> 00:13:25.890
Athena, but this time

00:13:26.390 --> 00:13:30.270
we used up all of our strengths.

00:13:30.900 --> 00:13:34.910
Even the Gold Cloths were
destroyed. We have nothing.

00:13:35.660 --> 00:13:38.080
What are you saying, Seiya?

00:13:38.410 --> 00:13:42.440
You still have life left.

00:13:42.770 --> 00:13:43.750
Life?

00:13:44.030 --> 00:13:45.120
Yes.

00:13:45.300 --> 00:13:50.200
Yes. The most precious thing given by God

00:13:50.200 --> 00:13:54.500
to all humans, no, to all living things.

00:13:55.230 --> 00:13:59.940
As long as you have life,
even if you lost everything,

00:14:00.040 --> 00:14:02.520
even if you were gravely wounded,

00:14:02.530 --> 00:14:06.780
you can still achieve
your infinite potential.

00:14:07.240 --> 00:14:10.530
You can make a miracle even
greater than God does.

00:14:11.750 --> 00:14:16.430
You have ignited your life
and exploded your Cosmo

00:14:16.430 --> 00:14:19.840
many times to cause miracles before.

00:14:20.600 --> 00:14:24.220
You must not give up as
long as you have life.

00:14:24.580 --> 00:14:28.930
As long as you have life,
you can make a miracle.

00:14:29.480 --> 00:14:31.050
I agree, Seiya.

00:14:31.870 --> 00:14:35.470
If you're defeated here, what
will happen to your sister?

00:14:35.940 --> 00:14:37.060
Marin.

00:14:37.930 --> 00:14:42.570
The sister you have been searching
for is right here, Seiya.

00:14:42.950 --> 00:14:46.670
Do you not want to see her, Seiya?

00:14:46.760 --> 00:14:48.260
That's right, Seiya.

00:14:48.260 --> 00:14:53.350
We promised we would protect
your sister with our lives.

00:14:53.540 --> 00:14:57.130
If Seiya gives up, our cause will be lost.

00:14:57.140 --> 00:14:58.580
Don't give up, Seiya!

00:14:58.910 --> 00:15:00.670
You can do it, Seiya!

00:15:00.960 --> 00:15:02.850
Seiya! Seiya!

00:15:03.950 --> 00:15:05.050
Seiya.

00:15:06.520 --> 00:15:09.320
My sister. My sister Seika.

00:15:10.180 --> 00:15:11.790
I'm alive.

00:15:12.030 --> 00:15:14.750
I'm here, my sister.

00:15:15.230 --> 00:15:17.900
Sister!

00:15:18.710 --> 00:15:21.870
Sister!

00:15:24.240 --> 00:15:25.490
That was...

00:15:26.880 --> 00:15:28.110
Seiya?

00:15:28.110 --> 00:15:29.070
Seiya!

00:15:29.940 --> 00:15:32.750
I heard Seiya's voice. Seiya's here.

00:15:32.970 --> 00:15:35.450
Where are you, Seiya? Seiya!

00:15:35.810 --> 00:15:38.400
Seiya!

00:15:41.840 --> 00:15:44.230
Seika is calling out Seiya's name.

00:15:44.370 --> 00:15:45.590
Her memory...

00:15:45.690 --> 00:15:47.060
Her memory is back.

00:15:47.420 --> 00:15:50.030
Seiya!

00:15:51.500 --> 00:15:54.910
I can hear sister's voice.

00:15:56.090 --> 00:15:57.810
Athena's voice.

00:15:58.410 --> 00:16:02.040
The voices of everyone cheering me on.

00:16:02.700 --> 00:16:04.080
That's right.

00:16:04.240 --> 00:16:06.050
I can't give up

00:16:07.210 --> 00:16:09.390
as long as I have this life!

00:16:10.010 --> 00:16:12.050
Exactly, Seiya.

00:16:12.470 --> 00:16:14.550
Ignite your life.

00:16:15.080 --> 00:16:19.150
Raise your Cosmo to the highest now.

00:16:19.890 --> 00:16:22.730
Infinitely higher than

00:16:22.730 --> 00:16:26.280
you have ever raised it before.

00:16:27.130 --> 00:16:31.160
Impossible, he stood up again.

00:16:31.540 --> 00:16:33.420
Didn't he lose everything

00:16:33.550 --> 00:16:36.560
and couldn't go on anymore and died?

00:16:36.560 --> 00:16:37.820
What's this?

00:16:38.790 --> 00:16:40.140
No way!

00:16:40.140 --> 00:16:41.530
What the hell is this?

00:16:42.340 --> 00:16:46.730
The obliterated remains that were
barely clinging to his body,

00:16:47.150 --> 00:16:51.300
the ashes of the Bronze Cloth
are burning like flames.

00:16:52.910 --> 00:16:56.570
What is this uneasy feeling?

00:16:57.110 --> 00:17:00.780
I'm also worried Thanatos is taking

00:17:00.780 --> 00:17:02.640
too long with those Bronze Saints.

00:17:03.010 --> 00:17:07.130
They wear the Bronze Cloths
revived by Athena's blood

00:17:07.130 --> 00:17:10.370
and have miraculously reached Elysion.

00:17:11.500 --> 00:17:15.410
But that can't be the last of the miracles

00:17:15.470 --> 00:17:19.240
caused by the blood of Athena.

00:17:21.800 --> 00:17:23.180
I remember!

00:17:23.640 --> 00:17:27.270
This happened once in ancient times.

00:17:28.840 --> 00:17:32.490
A Cloth revived by the blood of God

00:17:33.390 --> 00:17:36.820
will become Kamui which is
able to surpass anything.

00:17:37.840 --> 00:17:40.070
Impossible! The ashes of the

00:17:40.070 --> 00:17:44.240
Bronze Cloth have been revived!

00:17:47.480 --> 00:17:48.250
Seiya.

00:17:48.250 --> 00:17:49.440
Is this...

00:17:49.440 --> 00:17:50.480
What is this?

00:17:51.870 --> 00:17:54.180
What is this greatness I feel from him?

00:17:54.610 --> 00:17:58.500
I have never seen nor heard of such Cloth.

00:17:59.090 --> 00:18:03.640
The holiness that radiates
from the Cloth is just like...

00:18:03.710 --> 00:18:04.410
That's right.

00:18:07.700 --> 00:18:08.930
It's Kamui.

00:18:09.060 --> 00:18:11.870
Hypnos, what did you just say?

00:18:12.610 --> 00:18:15.850
This resurrected Cloth of Pegasus is...

00:18:16.080 --> 00:18:18.310
Is Kamui, that's what I said.

00:18:19.570 --> 00:18:20.750
Kamui!

00:18:22.410 --> 00:18:23.630
Kamui.

00:18:24.340 --> 00:18:26.980
Impossible! What do you mean Kamui?

00:18:27.560 --> 00:18:31.730
Kamui can only be worn by Zeus

00:18:32.020 --> 00:18:35.780
and the chosen gods of Olympus!

00:18:36.460 --> 00:18:39.390
Then how?

00:18:39.810 --> 00:18:42.850
How can such a worm wear it?

00:18:42.850 --> 00:18:43.970
Calm down, Thanatos.

00:18:44.710 --> 00:18:48.870
Why were these mortals able
to cross the dimensions

00:18:48.870 --> 00:18:50.860
into Elysion where only
Gods are allowed to pass?

00:18:51.640 --> 00:18:53.550
That's because of Athena's blood...

00:18:56.280 --> 00:18:58.710
That's right. Do you remember?

00:18:58.850 --> 00:19:03.900
A Cloth revived by the blood of
God grows as powerful as Kamui.

00:19:03.980 --> 00:19:06.380
In other words, it becomes a God Cloth.

00:19:06.580 --> 00:19:09.370
We have witnessed this

00:19:09.370 --> 00:19:11.430
once in ancient times.

00:19:12.210 --> 00:19:13.530
God Cloth.

00:19:13.530 --> 00:19:16.030
Bronze, Silver, Gold,

00:19:16.180 --> 00:19:20.380
it surpasses all those, which
becomes closest to Kamui.

00:19:20.860 --> 00:19:23.990
Seiya received the strength
from Athena's blood

00:19:23.990 --> 00:19:26.440
to raise his Cosmo to the limit

00:19:26.440 --> 00:19:29.170
and resurrected that Cloth.

00:19:29.170 --> 00:19:31.420
The legendary God Cloth.

00:19:32.460 --> 00:19:33.730
God Cloth.

00:19:35.310 --> 00:19:37.470
Not only were we able to
cross the dimensions...

00:19:37.640 --> 00:19:40.270
The Cloth revived by

00:19:40.270 --> 00:19:42.860
Athena's blood held this great secret.

00:19:43.840 --> 00:19:49.000
Hypnos, did you come because
you were worried about this?

00:19:49.000 --> 00:19:53.300
Yes. Pegasus is now no ordinary Saint.

00:19:53.440 --> 00:19:56.140
Don't take him too lightly.

00:19:56.140 --> 00:19:57.350
I won't accept that.

00:19:57.350 --> 00:19:57.690
What?

00:19:58.240 --> 00:20:02.310
Even if the God Cloth is close to Kamui,

00:20:02.470 --> 00:20:06.930
it's still a Cloth. What do
we Gods have to fear of it?

00:20:06.930 --> 00:20:10.160
And what can this dying mortal do?

00:20:11.980 --> 00:20:13.190
Stop it, Thanatos!

00:20:14.140 --> 00:20:18.200
It's light. It's like my strength
has revived along with the Cloth.

00:20:18.200 --> 00:20:21.570
Thanatos, I'll have you
return the Athena Cloth!

00:20:21.570 --> 00:20:23.480
Take it if you can!

00:20:31.270 --> 00:20:35.940
Absurd, he was almost dead a minute ago.

00:20:35.940 --> 00:20:37.920
He's like a different person.

00:20:38.040 --> 00:20:42.880
I will deliver this to Athena.
Now, get out of the way, Thanatos.

00:20:43.520 --> 00:20:45.940
Fool, don't get ahead of yourself!

00:20:46.040 --> 00:20:50.040
The only place you're going is to hell!

00:20:50.250 --> 00:20:53.100
Take this! Terrible Providence!

00:20:53.150 --> 00:20:54.440
Seiya!

00:21:00.690 --> 00:21:05.180
What? He took the Terrible
Providence head on.

00:21:05.260 --> 00:21:07.360
And he didn't even try to avoid it.

00:21:07.360 --> 00:21:08.180
Thanatos.

00:21:08.510 --> 00:21:13.150
It seems you were a second rank God
who only played with life and death.

00:21:14.260 --> 00:21:15.690
What did you say?

00:21:16.150 --> 00:21:17.520
Get out of the way, Thanatos!

00:21:17.840 --> 00:21:20.450
Pegasus Meteor!

00:21:25.210 --> 00:21:26.040
What?

00:21:28.970 --> 00:21:31.800
This is the power of the God Cloth.

00:21:36.050 --> 00:21:38.910
I did it. I finally defeated Thanatos.

00:21:40.940 --> 00:21:41.570
Seiya!

00:21:42.830 --> 00:21:45.000
Pegasus Comet!

00:21:47.680 --> 00:21:50.730
Impossible! I'm a God,

00:21:50.850 --> 00:21:53.360
and I'm being defeated by a human.

00:21:53.430 --> 00:21:54.670
God defeated

00:21:55.400 --> 00:21:57.340
by a human.

00:22:00.240 --> 00:22:01.610
Thanatos.

00:22:03.570 --> 00:22:04.600
Seiya.

00:22:06.320 --> 00:22:09.310
We need to deliver this
Cloth to Athena quickly.

00:22:19.140 --> 00:22:22.640
Wait, Miss Saori!

00:24:04.370 --> 00:24:06.760
The God Cloths are revived
with Athena's blood.

00:24:06.860 --> 00:24:10.480
Donning those sacred Cloths,
we proceed to the Hades Temple.

00:24:10.540 --> 00:24:12.970
However, what awaited us there

00:24:12.970 --> 00:24:15.430
was overwhelming power that
can turn everything into darkness.

00:24:15.640 --> 00:24:18.970
He finally shows his true form in Elysion.

00:24:19.650 --> 00:24:23.590
Are you saying we can't save
the Earth or Saori-san after all?

00:24:23.780 --> 00:24:26.530
Saint Seiya: Awakening from A Legend.

00:24:26.540 --> 00:24:29.420
Have you ever felt your Cosmo?
